hadiths[29]{hadithnumber,text}:
"294","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Subah pati jabke junubi; Aap ghusl farmate aur apne din ka roza rakhte."
"295","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha jabke darwaze par khade the, main sun rahi thin: Ya Rasulullah, main subah junubi hota hun jabke roze ka irada rakhta hun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: 'Main bhi subah junubi hota hun jabke roze ka irada rakhta hun; main ghusl karta hun phir us din ka roza rakhta hun.' To us aadmi ne kaha: Aap ham jaise nahin hain; Allah ne Aap ke agle pichhle gunah bakhsh diye hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghussa hue phir farmaya: 'Allah ki qasam, beshak mujhe ummeed hai ke main tum mein Allah Azz wa Jall se sab se zyada darne wala aur sab se zyada janne wala hun jis se main bachta hun.'"
"296","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr bin Abdir Rahman (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main aur mere walid Marwan bin Hakam, Madinah ke ameer ke paas the; zikr hua ke Abu Hurairah kehte hain: Jo subah junubi ho woh us din iftar kare. To Marwan ne kaha: Main tumhen qasam deta hun Ai Abdir Rahman, tum Ummul-Mumineen Aishah aur Umm Salamah ke paas is ke bare mein jao. Abu Bakr kehte hain: To Abdir Rahman gae aur main un ke sath gaya yahan tak ke ham Aishah ke paas dakhil hue; ham ne unhen salam kiya. Phir Abdir Rahman ne kaha: Ai Ummul-Mumineen, ham Marwan ke paas the; un se zikr kiya gaya ke Abu Hurairah kehte hain: Jo subah junubi ho woh us din iftar kare. To Aishah ne kaha: Jaisa Abu Hurairah ne kaha waisa nahin; Ai Abdir Rahman, kya tum us se moo modte ho jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) karte the?! Ravi kehte hain: To Abdir Rahman ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam. Unhon ne kaha: To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par gawahi deti hun ke Aap subah junubi hote ehtelam ke baghair phir us din ka roza rakhte. Ravi kehte hain: Phir ham nikle yahan tak ke Umm Salamah ke paas dakhil hue; unhon ne un se is ke bare mein poocha; unhon ne waisa kaha jaisa Aishah (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha. Ravi kehte hain: To ham nikle yahan tak ke Marwan ke paas aae; Abdir Rahman ne un se un dono ka kaha zikr kiya. To Marwan ne kaha: Main tumhen qasam deta hun Ai Abu Muhammad, tum meri sawari par sawar ho, woh darwaze par hai; tum Abu Hurairah ke paas jao, woh Aqiq mein apni zameen mein hain; tum unhen yeh khabar do. Abu Bakr kehte hain: To Abdir Rahman sawar hue aur main un ke sath sawar hua yahan tak ke ham Abu Hurairah ke paas aae; Abdir Rahman ne un se ghadi bhar baat ki phir un se is ka zikr kiya. To Abu Hurairah ne kaha: 'Mujhe is ka ilm nahin; mujhe sirf khabar dene wale ne khabar di [jo ghalat thi].'"
"297","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah aur Umm Salamah, Ummahatul-Mumineen [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ramadan mein jima se junubi hote ehtelam se nahin, phir us din ka roza rakhte."
"298","[AI-translation] Abdir Rahman bin Qasim ke walid [Qasim] (Rahimahullah) se Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unhen bosa dete jabke rozedar hote. Unhon ne apna sar jhukaya sharm se aur thodi der khamosh rahe phir kaha: Ji."
"299","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bosa dete jabke rozedar hote."
"300","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bosa dete jabke rozedar hote. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Yeh hadees Lais bin Sa'd ki asl mein nahin; use un se sirf Yahya bin Hassan aur Abdul-Ghaffar bin Dawud Harrani ne bayan kiya."
"301","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah [Raziyallahu anhuma] se Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ek din bosa diya jabke rozedar tha; main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main ne aaj bada kaam kiya: Bosa diya jabke rozedar tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Batao agar tum kulli karo jabke rozedar ho?' Ravi kehte hain: To main ne kaha: Us mein koi harj nahin. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'To phir [bosa mein] kya [harj hai]?'"
"302","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe bosa dena chaha; main ne kaha: Main rozedar hun. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Main bhi rozedar hun'; Aap ne mujhe bosa diya."
"303","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah Ummul-Mumineen [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni ba'z azwaj ko bosa dete jabke rozedar hote, phir hanste."
"304","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ka'b bin Asim Ash'ari [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Safar mein roza neki mein se nahin [jab mashaqqat ho].'"
"305","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bosa dete jabke rozedar hote, mubashirat farmate jabke rozedar hote; Aap tum sab se apni khwahish par zyada qaboo rakhne wale the."
"306","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Hamzah bin Amr Aslami ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main lagatar roze rakhta hun; kya main safar mein roza rakhun? Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar chaho to roza rakho; agar chaho to iftar karo.'"
"307","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abud-Darda [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath safar mein the; ham mein se koi sakht garmi ki wajah se apne sar par apna hath rakhta; ham mein koi rozedar nahin tha siwae Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Abdullah bin Rawahah, ya Ibn Huzafah ke; shak Shafi'i ko, nahin jante ke Abdullah bin Rawahah hain ya Abdullah bin Huzafah."
"308","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah [Ibn Abbas Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fath wale saal Ramadan mein Makkah ki taraf nikle; Aap roza rakhte yahan tak ke Kadeed pahunche, phir iftar farmaya; log Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hukm mein se nae se nae par amal karte."
"309","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr bin Abdir Rahman (Rahimahullah) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ba'z sahaba se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon ko apne safar mein Fath wale saal iftar ka hukm diya. Aap ne farmaya: 'Apne dushman ke liye taqat hasil karo'; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) roza rakhte. Abu Bakr kehte hain: Mujhe bayan karne wale ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Arj mein apne sar par pyaas ya garmi ki wajah se pani dalte dekha. To kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, chand logon ne roza rakha jab Aap ne roza rakha. Ravi kehte hain: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Kadeed mein the to Aap ne pani ka pyala manga aur piya; logon ne iftar kiya."
"310","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Ramadan mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath safar kiya; rozedar ghair rozedar par aib na lagata, ghair rozedar rozedar par aib na lagata."
"311","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai ke Hamzah bin Amr Aslami ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Kya main safar mein roza rakhun? Woh kasrat se roze rakhte. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar chaho to roza rakho; agar chaho to iftar karo.'"
"312","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath safar kiya; ham mein rozedar aur ham mein ghair rozedar; rozedar ghair rozedar par aib na lagata, ghair rozedar rozedar par aib na lagata."
"313","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath safar karte; ham mein rozedar aur ham mein ghair rozedar; ghair rozedar rozedar par aib na lagata, rozedar ghair rozedar par aib na lagata; un ki rae thi ke jo taqat pae aur roza rakhe woh achcha khub hai, jo kamzori pae aur iftar kare woh achcha khub hai."
"314","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah, Ibn Abdir Rahman (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas dakhil hua; main ne kaha: Ai ammi, mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke rozon ke bare mein khabar den. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) roza rakhte yahan tak ke ham kehte: Unhon ne roza rakha; iftar farmate yahan tak ke ham kehte: Unhon ne iftar farmaya. Main ne Aap ko kisi mahine mein Shaban se zyada roze rakhte nahin dekha; Aap use sara rakhte, balke use siwae thode ke rakhte."
"315","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) roza rakhte yahan tak ke ham kehte: Iftar nahin farmayenge; iftar farmate yahan tak ke ham kehte: Roza nahin rakhenge. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Ramadan ke siwa kisi mahine ka mukammal roza rakhte nahin dekha; main ne Aap ko Shaban se zyada roze rakhte nahin dekha."
"316","[AI-translation] Salim se apne walid [Abdullah bin Umar Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Lailatul-Qadr dekhi; us ne kaha: Main ne dekha ke woh falan falan raat hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main dekhta hun tumhare khwab mil gae hain; use aakhri dus mein us ki taq raaton mein talash karo', ya 'baqi saat mein'. Sufyan ko shak hua: Unhon ne kaha: 'Taq mein', ya 'baqi saat mein'."
"317","[AI-translation] Zirr bin Hubaysh (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ubayy bin Ka'b se kaha: Beshak tumhare bhai Ibn Mas'ud kehte hain: Jo saal bhar [qiyam] kare Lailatul-Qadr pa le. To unhon ne kaha: Allah Abu Abdir Rahman par rehem farmaye; unhen maloom tha ke woh Ramadan mein hai, ke woh sattaiswin raat hai; lekin unhon ne chaha ke woh us par bharosa na karen. Phir Ubayy ne baghair istisna qasam khai ke woh Ramadan ki sattaiswin raat hai. Main ne kaha: Ai Abul-Munzir, tum use kaise jante ho? Unhon ne kaha: Us nishani se jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham ko khabar di ke suraj us din ki subah baghair shua ke nikalta hai."
"318","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ramadan mein hamare paas nikle aur farmaya: 'Mujhe yeh raat dikhai gayi yahan tak ke do aadmi jhagde; woh utha li gayi; use nawin, satwin aur panchwin [baqi] mein talash karo.'"
"319","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se chand aadmiyon ko Lailatul-Qadr khwab mein aakhri saat mein dikhai gayi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main dekhta hun tumhare khwab aakhri saat mein mil gae hain; tum mein se jo use talash kare woh use aakhri saat mein talash kare.'"
"320","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Lailatul-Qadr ko aakhri saat mein talash karo.'"
"321","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo Lailatul-Qadr mein iman aur sawab ki ummeed ke sath [qiyam] kare, us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jayenge.'"
"322","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubadah bin Samit [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ke paas nikle jabke Aap unhen Lailatul-Qadr batana chahte the; do aadmi jhagde. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Main nikla jabke main tumhen Lailatul-Qadr batana chahta tha; falan aur falan jhagde; ho sakta hai yeh tumhare liye behtar ho; use nawin, satwin aur panchwin [baqi] mein talash karo.'"
